<title>GREECE: ATHLETICS-ENGQUIST WINS WORLD 100 METRES HURDLES TITLE.</title>
<headline>ATHLETICS-ENGQUIST WINS WORLD 100 METRES HURDLES TITLE.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-08-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swede Ludmila Engquist won the 100 metres hurdles gold medal on Sunday.</p>
<p>Svetla Dimitrova of Bulgaria took the silver and Jamaican Michelle Freeman the bronze.</p>
</text>
